# MEETING — in a call. Derived from base.pet `sit`; every frame wears the headset.
#
# Headphones: identical to music.pet (music_4) and events.pet headphones_on —
#   k outline row 2 cols 4-9, g band row 3 cols 5-8; cups rows 4-6 = outer column
#   (g top, d below) + inner G column over the head edge (cols 1-2 / 11-12), k outside (cols 0 / 13).
# Boom mic: G arm from under the left cup (7,1) to the chin (8,2)(8,3), d tip at (8,4);
#   k outline outside the silhouette at (7,0)(8,1)(9,2). Coordinates are (row,col).
# Mouth open (meet_talk_2): `pp` at row 8 cols 6-7 (same as music_excited).
# Listen: ear tips 1 row lower (row 0 empty) = ears slightly back; calm 1-px eyes on row 6.
# Status icons top-right share one r slash (0,12)(1,13)(2,14)(3,15):
#   meet_muted       light g mic capsule (0,14)(1,14) on a G stem (3,14)(4,14) — tall and thin
#   meet_camera_off  G 3x2 camera body rows 1-2 cols 13-15 — wide and darker
# Laptop (meet_type_*): same laptop, arms, paws and bb glow as coding.pet code_type_1 / code_type_3.
#   Eyes stay forward (not looking down) so the left eye does not stack on the mic tip.

@frame meet_talk_1
..k........k....
.kok......kok...
.kwokkkkkkowk...
.kwooggggoowk...
